<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<speak version="1.0" xml:lang="en-US" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis">
  <voice name="en-US-JennyNeural">
    <prosody rate="-8%" pitch="+2%">
      Then up trotted Pip, with a cup and a map,<break time="350ms"/>A red little hat and a blue little cap.<break time="350ms"/>?What?s all this shouting by hill, lake, and tree?<break time="350ms"/>A snake and a goat are too loud before tea!?
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
